            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashitseyo, Abalewi barerura iyo sandugu y’ Imana, bashira iminiho yayo ku bitugu, nk’uko Mose yageze, bivuye kw ijambo ry’Uhoraho.",
          "type": "text",
