            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw Abalewi batora Hemani mwene Yoweli; no muri bagenzi be batora Asafu mwene Berekiya; no muri bagenzi babo b’aba Merari batora Etani mwene Kushaya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hamwe na bo batora ivyungirizi vya kabiri, Zekariya na Yaziyeli na Shemiramoti na Yehiyeli na Uni na Eliyabu na Benaya na Mayaseya na Matitiya na Elifelehu na Mikuneya, bo n’abo gushibama, Obed‐edomu na Yeyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw abo baririmvyi, Hemani na Asafu na Etani, bavuza ivyitwa matowazi vy’imiringa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zekariya na Yaziyeli na Shemiramoti na Yehiyeli na Uni na Eliyabu na Mayaseya na Benaya bavugira amakembe mu kajwi karangurutse; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matitiya na Elifelehu na Mikuneya na Obed‐edomu na Yeyeli na Azaziya bavugira inanga z’ijwi ritūza, bakaba ari bo batera indirimbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenaniya, umukuru w’Abalewi, ni we yaganza ivyo kuririmba; ni we yaririmbisha kuko yar’ umuhinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Berekiya na Elukana ni bo bār’ abashibamyi b’iyo sandugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
